{
    "word": "elliptical",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "6516d8ec-c732-3817-92d9-9a6ae617f988",
                "word": "elliptical",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "cd443421-2ea1-4f9b-8c33-32a08e37d84b",
                        "entry_id": "6516d8ec-c732-3817-92d9-9a6ae617f988",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more elliptical"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "554ff6b6-d502-4c94-8ab6-178878762343",
                        "entry_id": "6516d8ec-c732-3817-92d9-9a6ae617f988",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most elliptical"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bda4b93e-f645-3fa3-8a71-73301f270c08",
                        "entry_id": "6516d8ec-c732-3817-92d9-9a6ae617f988",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a shape of, or reminding of, an ellipse; oval."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b0900d16-2a15-4ee5-a253-570bf551877a",
                                "sense_id": "bda4b93e-f645-3fa3-8a71-73301f270c08",
                                "text": "Having admitted that the projectile was describing an orbit around the moon, this orbit must necessarily be elliptical; science proves that it must be so."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b3fe94c1-230b-3f1a-a4f8-718b0cda1645",
                        "entry_id": "6516d8ec-c732-3817-92d9-9a6ae617f988",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of, or showing ellipsis; having a word or words omitted."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "06fd6dd6-d34f-4e1d-acb5-67a317ad18e7",
                                "sense_id": "b3fe94c1-230b-3f1a-a4f8-718b0cda1645",
                                "text": "If he is sometimes elliptical and obscure, it is because he has so much to tell us."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "66c30ba1-407d-3cd2-888d-04d1dc9481b6",
                        "entry_id": "6516d8ec-c732-3817-92d9-9a6ae617f988",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Concise, condensed."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "of speech"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ff50e4ad-9ccb-4051-a3ab-2507009b0a6c",
                                "sense_id": "66c30ba1-407d-3cd2-888d-04d1dc9481b6",
                                "text": "Browning's dark and elliptical mode of speech, like his love of the grotesque, was simply a characteristic of his, a trick of his temperament, and had little or nothing to do with whether what he was expressing was profound or superficial."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "60759061-c906-4c9f-9d22-6f66c352b96b",
                                "sense_id": "66c30ba1-407d-3cd2-888d-04d1dc9481b6",
                                "text": "He was called a tramp; but that was only an elliptical way of saying that he was a philosopher, an artist, a traveller, a naturalist and a discoverer."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "acf6628c-5a97-382e-bf17-8422b60af4fc",
                        "entry_id": "6516d8ec-c732-3817-92d9-9a6ae617f988",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Elliptic."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
